''Current pilot:'' <$count filter="[tag[Mandarin Vocabulary]]"/> vocabulary tiddlers.

The general 7,000-word plus 1,000–2,000 wuxia-specialist target is a standalone lexical inventory. Teaching lessons and thematic collections can reference this inventory selectively. Each lexical entry exists only once; lesson assignment is optional metadata and does not determine whether a word belongs to the lexicon.
